DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261107T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261107T163000
UID:6931f2a276261f28005d7d6b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This program helps people stay active\, make friends\, learn n
 ew skills\, and have fun. Meet new folks\, build connections\, and tell us
  about programs and services you would like to see in the neighbourhood!\n
 Come and join the F.R.E.S.H. group for a Saturday screening of popular mov
 ies.\nWe'll be playing the following films\nNovember 7th – Klute\nNovem
 ber 14rh – The Trip\nNovember 21st – The Apostle\nNovember 28th – Lo
 cal Hero\nDrop in\, no registration is required.\nSnacks and refreshments 
 are provided for all participants. Ingredient lists will be available at t
 he program.\nThis program is in collaboration with\nGerstein Crisis Centre
 's F.R.E.S.H. initiative\n.
LOCATION:Toronto Reference Library\, First floor\, Activity Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6931f2a276261f28005d7d6b
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
