BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:NEW DATE: Runnymede Film Club Presents: Sinners
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261027T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261027T200000
UID:6a909e1e1c197d11325b4d51@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a monthly film screening of\nSinners\n(2025\, Rate
 d R).\nTrying to leave their troubled lives behind\, twin brothers Smoke a
 nd Stack return to their hometown to start again\, only to discover that a
 n even greater evil is waiting to welcome them back.\nDrop-in.\n*Please no
 te\, this program will now take place on Tuesday\, October 27th from 5:30-
 8 pm.
LOCATION:Runnymede\, 2nd Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a909e1e1c197d11325b4d51
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
