BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tea & Movies - Jerry & Marge Go Large (2022)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261111T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261111T160000
UID:6ac65bb2901b02002cc0b052@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us every month for a free afternoon movie.\nThis month's 
 movie:\nJerry & Marge Go Large\nWhen retiree Jerry Selbee discovers a math
 ematical loophole in the Massachusetts lottery\, he and his wife Marge go 
 on an exciting multi-million dollar winning spree to revive their small Mi
 chigan town. But when a selfish college student cheats the system\, Jerry 
 must find a way to make the game fair for all.\nLight refreshments served 
 before the movie.
LOCATION:Hillcrest\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac65bb2901b02002cc0b052
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
