DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261124T150000
UID:6ac9530c96ec3a003ad97cf1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an afternoon of creative crafts. Create\, socializ
 e and make fun unique designs!\nRegistration is required. Limited to 12 pa
 rticipants. Register online through TPL.ca\nNovember 24:\nFelt Needling Ba
 sics
LOCATION:St. James Town
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac9530c96ec3a003ad97cf1
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Delicious and Surprising History of The Dining Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261112T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261112T200000
UID:6ab59d0d3dd190003e74663e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join author John Ota and explore the stories behind twelve ico
 nic dining rooms in homes around the world—from a Japanese samurai house
  to Claude Monet's brilliant yellow dining room to Frida Kahlo's Casa Azul
  to Jackie Kennedy’s White House—and travel through time in pursuit of
  the ultimate design.\nThe Dining Room\nbook will be available for sale at
  $35.00 each – payment by E-transfer or cash (exact change appreciated).
 \nDrop in\, no registration required.\nThe Dining Room
LOCATION:Brentwood\, Community Room\, Ground Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab59d0d3dd190003e74663e
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Adult Afternoon Movie - Is This Thing On? (2025)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261201T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261201T160000
UID:6ab2cc01001a4a0e055b355c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:As their marriage quietly unravels\, Alex (Will Arnett) faces
  middle age and an impeding divorce\, seeking new purpose in the New York
  comedy scene while\, his wife Tess (Laura Dern) confronts sacrifices mad
 e for their family\, forcing them to navigate co-parenting\, identity\, an
 d whether love can take a new form.\nR\, 121 minutes\n**Subtitles for the 
 deaf and hard of hearing when available (SDH).
LOCATION:Riverdale\, Program Room 1
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab2cc01001a4a0e055b355c
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
