DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261028T153000
UID:6a67b9d60e562e28009cd4e2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us every month at the College/Shaw Library for our Adult
  Crafternoon Social!\nDrop in for some coffee and light music while explor
 ing your creative abilities with a simple craft or art project. A great op
 portunity to socialize in a relaxed and friendly space. Materials provided
 \, but feel free to bring in something you're already working on!\nWed Aug
  19\nWed Sept 23\nWed Oct 28
LOCATION:College/Shaw\, In basement auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a67b9d60e562e28009cd4e2
