SUMMARY:Fact or Fiction: Identifying and Combatting Misinformation and Dis
 information
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261029T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261029T153000
UID:6aac28b4f9ed2e0038516d00@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Are you ready to separate fact from fiction in a world filled 
 with misinformation and disinformation? Join us for an interactive and en
 tertaining program where we'll dive into the fascinating world of misinfo
 rmation\, exploring its origins\, impact\, and how to combat it effective
 ly. This program is perfect for curious minds of all ages who want to arm
  themselves with the skills needed to navigate the complex landscape of o
 nline information responsibly and safely.\nInformation Collection Notice:
 \nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public
