DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261103T150000
UID:6a839956386764026a175163@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join other book lovers in your community and participate in li
 vely discussions of popular books. This book club will meet every First Tu
 esday of the month for a lively discussion in a welcoming\, relaxed settin
 g. New members are always welcome and encouraged to join.\nSeptember 1\n\,
  2026 -\nWildflower Hill by Kimberley Freeman\nOctober 6\n\, 2026 –\nBad
  Cree by Jessica Johns\nNovember 3\, 2026 –\nThe Thursday Murder Club by
  Richard Osman\nDecember 1\, 2026 –\nOn the Ravine by Vincent Lam\nCopie
 s of the book are available for borrowing at the Port Union Library.\nDro
 p-in\, no registration necessary.
LOCATION:Port Union\, Meeting Room
