  afternoon of painting and community. Local artist\nJenny Li\nwill guide p
 articipants step-by-step in creating a beautiful fall landscape on a 12" x
  16" canvas using acrylic paints.\nWhether you're an experienced artist or
  picking up a paintbrush for the first time\, you'll leave with your own s
 easonal masterpiece to take home.\nRegistration is required. Space is limi
 ted.
LOCATION:Victoria Village
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa55ee765abe8002a78a2e2
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
