UID:699cdbfa4a9fd98b7f800fc6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Each month we will explore and discuss a title that falls into
  one of the TPL Reading Challenge categories.\nThis month we will be disc
 ussing\nCategory Is – Cold Weather\nMoon of the Crusted Snow\nby Waubge
 shig  Rice\nA daring post-apocalyptic novel from a powerful rising literar
 y voice. With winter looming\, a small northern Anishinaabe community goes
  dark. Cut off\, people become passive and confused. Panic builds as the f
 ood supply dwindles.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal informa
