SUMMARY:Make a Will
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261103T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261103T113000
UID:6a2c1b5416554cd59fc85703@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This seminar will discuss how you can create a simple will\, a
 ppoint an executor for your estate\, and more. In collaboration with Senio
 r Persons Living Connected\, Seniors And Law Enforcement Together\, and th
 e Toronto Police Service (42 Division).\nRegistration starts on Oct 1\, ca
 ll SPLC at 416-493-3333 x820 or\nemail\nenglish@splc.ca\n\, spaces are lim
 ited.
LOCATION:Bridlewood\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a2c1b5416554cd59fc85703
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
