DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261010T110000
UID:6a9489c960ccaf01c02227a6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Seniors E-Connect matches older adults with a teen volunteer t
 o provide tech help\, under the guidance of library staff. Learn the basic
 s of using computers\, tablets and smartphones and popular websites and so
 ftware.\nSeniors\, please register. Drop-in may be allowed while there are
  enough volunteers available.\nIf you're a teen between the ages of 13-17 
 and would like to learn more about becoming a Seniors E-Connect volunteer\
 , visit the\nSeniors E-Connect Volunteering page\nor contact the branch.\n
 Information Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is c
