SUMMARY:Planting Bulbs in the Fall for Spring Glory
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261020T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261020T193000
UID:6abc26f89d27a000454d7dd5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Planting bulbs in the fall will bring glorious rewards in your
  spring garden. A Toronto Master Gardener will give advice on what to plan
 t\, how to plant them and yes\, even a few pointers on squirrels! At the e
 nd of the program\, bulbs will be given out to attendees\, while supplies 
